 "remarks": "Discover the incredible space and comfort of this surprisingly spacious Raised Ranch! From the moment you arrive, you will appreciate the convenience of an expansive driveway accommodating up to 4 vehicles, along with a handy attached garage. Inside, the main layout offers an abundance of living space just waiting for your personal touch. The lower level provides fantastic flexibility and a excellent possibility for an in-law apartment. Step outside to a large, beautiful flat level lot featuring a wonderful covered porch that is absolutely perfect for outdoor entertaining. Equipped with active solar panels for excellent energy efficiency, this home is situated in a highly convenient Stamford location near shopping, restaurants, parks, etc. Bring your favorite paint colors and refreshing ideas to customize this wonderful property and make it your own!",
